{"article":{"id":30828415556881,"url":"https://lovescape.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/30828415556881.json","html_url":"https://help.lovescape.com/hc/en-us/articles/30828415556881-Lovescape-Chips-What-They-Are-How-They-Work-and-How-to-Use-Them","author_id":26284011178897,"comments_disabled":true,"draft":false,"promoted":false,"position":0,"vote_sum":-33,"vote_count":95,"upvote_count":31,"downvote_count":64,"section_id":26017175142417,"created_at":"2024-12-10T14:11:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:24:40Z","name":"Lovescape Chips: What They Are, How They Work and How to Use Them","title":"Lovescape Chips: What They Are, How They Work and How to Use Them","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2026-06-08T09:55:26Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":2599957,"content_tag_ids":[],"label_names":[],"body":"<h2 id=\"h_01KNPG4X9G2SMPMGCB8WFW1X47\" data-section-id=\"5kvqs2\" data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"219\">What Are Chips on Lovescape?</h2><p data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"330\"><strong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"230\">Chips</strong> are the internal token-based currency used on Lovescape to unlock additional features and services.</p><p data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"473\">They allow users to access premium functionality beyond the standard subscription, especially for <a href=\"https://lovescape.com/ai-porn-image-generator\"><strong data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"472\">AI-powered tools like image generation</strong></a>.</p><h2 id=\"h_01KNPG54VP1A3S34EDRWGFQA4Y\" data-section-id=\"1xjrxzd\" data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"514\">Key Features of Lovescape Chips</h2><ul data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"660\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1qoxgls\" data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"554\" data-list-item-id=\"ec75022c3fb8a071b0cda8f8233f7ba45\">Available only to subscribed users</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9i8u72\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"582\" data-list-item-id=\"ee9729ead851041910ef6241b6204669a\">Do not expire over time</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hfdb5y\" data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"616\" data-list-item-id=\"ec4ad0c79131268ef778cb92f63df1a09\">Non-refundable once purchased</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w11lkg\" data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"660\" data-list-item-id=\"e2064d52af2eef389767f5c95f259f64c\">Used as a flexible pay-as-you-go system</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"h_01KNPG5EVKDGKWXCKNJ9S9K4BQ\" data-section-id=\"18w5y2b\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"697\">Types of Chips on Lovescape</h2><p data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"735\">Lovescape offers two types of Chips:</p><h3 id=\"h_01KNPG5EVMW5599TAD9CB40W2Y\" data-section-id=\"1bi8vg7\" data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"759\">1. Purchased Chips</h3><ul data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"867\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1iuc06i\" data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"788\" data-list-item-id=\"e3eab6a349ea180afcb8988f12d129cdb\">Bought directly by users</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qums8c\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"824\" data-list-item-id=\"e5c00dce7741e14b5d18d1bf6b6f109a4\">Used to access premium features</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"172z72x\" data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"867\" data-list-item-id=\"edc674b3b3e32af958fe0d3f877cc2c4f\">Available anytime through your account</li>\n</ul><h3 id=\"h_01KNPG5RAEZJ80X3Z7QB1DDE7D\" data-section-id=\"5noer8\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"892\">2. Promo Chips</h3><ul data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1056\">\n<li data-section-id=\"158miwy\" data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"949\" data-list-item-id=\"e492628d3178144983a1672083dc50701\">Distributed through promotions, events, or giveaways</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1uf7qox\" data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1006\" data-list-item-id=\"e7753ada402f6ab5ae13234c72f0f45da\">Often announced via official channels (e.g. Discord)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1dookml\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1056\" data-list-item-id=\"e49f1328b67c19ccc850d542ba367bc30\">Limited-time opportunities to earn free Chips</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1137\">Tip: Follow Lovescape on social platforms to stay updated on new promotions.</p><h2 id=\"h_01KNPG63TPH95CJNAJPX03HZS1\" data-section-id=\"esqesm\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1174\">What Can You Use Chips For?</h2><p data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1242\">Chips are primarily used for <a href=\"https://lovescape.com/ai-porn-image-generator\"><strong data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1228\">AI image generation</strong></a> on Lovescape.</p><ul data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1402\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1mig0hk\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1296\" data-list-item-id=\"ea82164e22fd2a04b688f16d7fac57e3e\">Each image shows its Chip cost before generation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1tp1q9\" data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1345\" data-list-item-id=\"e66295e7733551365da6b4e334d930c74\">You only spend Chips when generating content</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1czy7bc\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1402\" data-list-item-id=\"e8f44eb7044e83c296cc80854748577bf\">Pricing may vary depending on complexity or features</li>\n</ul><p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1474\">This system gives users full control over how they spend their tokens.</p><h2 id=\"h_01KNPG69HJ72B07F1Q2BVY5H3S\" data-section-id=\"up1rry\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1515\">How to Check Your Chips Balance</h2><p data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1549\">You can easily track your Chips:</p><ul data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1675\">\n<li data-section-id=\"v1u2yq\" data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1626\" data-list-item-id=\"ea20d82a564b747aa70bf67c1f49708d7\">Your current balance is shown in the <strong data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1610\">top-right corner</strong> of the screen</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vqgzbn\" data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1675\" data-list-item-id=\"eb18339a70d89b6a25572830cb9392bf0\">Click on your balance to view detailed usage</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"h_01KNPG6GKRVMY8894GKXSVD0M1\" data-section-id=\"1n7n0ec\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1713\">Token History and Management</h2><p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1774\">Lovescape provides full transparency for all Chip activity.</p><p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1818\">In the <strong data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1800\">Token History</strong> section, you can:</p><ul data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1920\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1ahb62k\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1842\" data-list-item-id=\"ed9ae9b1d5f710f5aa3462f6cedbcb249\">View all purchases</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mas6rv\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1861\" data-list-item-id=\"eb723f942e43cb98fe331102809150e95\">Track spending</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4ra01b\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1887\" data-list-item-id=\"e8aee6d433afb01b54ace63d76196c992\">Monitor promo rewards</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3lhl0j\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1920\" data-list-item-id=\"edfa31c2c2c81af0ba0d4dbfa3bbaf126\">Analyze your usage over time</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"h_01KNPG6P3X9WYXSDF3XB41MDJN\" data-section-id=\"9llmmq\" data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1957\">Important Rules About Chips</h2><ul data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2093\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1ey9lwk\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1982\" data-list-item-id=\"e32e0ee6e27308fd0dc471968801c1572\">Chips do not expire</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1f3pnd\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2011\" data-list-item-id=\"e37bebf6fb551d64d5620b1a11abc6536\">Chips are non-refundable</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kjm8x4\" data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2046\" data-list-item-id=\"e2c5fc15f19efc25d00172f1fc17f28cc\">Chips are tied to your account</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hoxuan\" data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2093\" data-list-item-id=\"e31fe5ed0e41f89b736eb3766d7a578cf\">Only active subscribers can purchase Chips</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"h_01KNPG6WMMZMF50N762ZGPFDK0\" data-section-id=\"146rhvq\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2127\">Why Lovescape Uses Chips</h2><p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2153\">The Chips system allows:</p><ul data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2289\">\n<li data-section-id=\"4zr5lq\" data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2194\" data-list-item-id=\"e2b51e49275b0664c3a631d04a88b687a\">Flexible access to premium features</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ebwvzj\" data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2224\" data-list-item-id=\"eb5cffd17b9906c71587dfec5d5bff72c\">Pay-per-use functionality</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncy8xp\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2257\" data-list-item-id=\"ee963e5a4b4178c784735053a4e77c2d8\">Better control over spending</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"q23xf\" data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2289\" data-list-item-id=\"ee7755ad7a9b1d9ab7186b0fc8b451d9a\">Scalable access to AI tools</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"h_01KNPG75J6Y551BGWRY6V4ZMXG\" data-section-id=\"sm0eho\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2319\">FAQ: Lovescape Chips</h2><p data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2380\"><strong data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2341\">Do Chips expire?</strong><br>No, Chips remain valid indefinitely.</p><p data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2460\"><strong data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2415\">Can I get a refund for Chips?</strong><br>No, all Chip purchases are non-refundable.</p><p data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2526\"><strong data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2484\">Who can buy Chips?</strong><br>Only users with an active subscription.</p><p data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2615\"><strong data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2563\">What are Chips mainly used for?</strong><br>Chips are primarily used for <a href=\"https://lovescape.com/ai-porn-image-generator\">AI image generation</a>.</p><p data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2700\"><strong data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2652\">Where can I see my Chips usage?</strong><br>In the Token History section of your profile.</p>"}}